00:57:58.030 --> 00:58:03.000
<v Ruby Held>I can't believe what this man has done. I'm sitting there, thinking, "I must be in Russia."
<v Ruby Held>我不敢相信这个人做了什么。我坐在那儿想，“我一定是在俄罗斯。”

00:58:03.000 --> 00:58:54.910
